  📗
    Lays the config file and the environment over the settings as they stand:
    the file GRAPEVINE_CONFIG names (or grapevine.json, if there is one), then
    PORT, then a GRAPEVINE_ variable for each setting. What was set in code
    before this is a default; what is set after it wins. Anything wrong is
    reported when the server starts.
